> crit (x>=0 ? x : -x)
critical points of x >= 0 ? x : -x:
  x >= 0 ? x : -x' = x >= 0 ? 1 : -1
  x ≈ -1.972152263e-33: local minimum, x >= 0 ? x : -x = 1.972152263e-33
  searched [-10, 10] (default; give x a range)
> crit (x>=0 ? x^2 : -x^2)
critical points of x >= 0 ? x^2 : -x^2:
  x >= 0 ? x^2 : -x^2' = x >= 0 ? 2x : -2x
  x ≈ 0: stationary inflection, x >= 0 ? x^2 : -x^2 = 0
  searched [-10, 10] (default; give x a range)
> crit max(x,0)+min(x,0)
critical points of max(x, 0) + min(x, 0):
  max(x, 0) + min(x, 0)' = (x >= 0 ? 1 : 0) + (x <= 0 ? 1 : 0)
  none in [-10, 10]
  searched [-10, 10] (default; give x a range)
